get.description:
Downloads an operator's available departure dates in bulk.

This endpoint is supposed to be used to download large amount of data, and import them into the partner's own database or system for faster access.

The response of this endpoint will be a list of URLs.
Each one of them points to a (gzip-compressed) JSON file containing up to 500 tours.
For each tour, all available departure dates will be listed. 

The URLs are signed for download, and are only valid for a limited amount of time (10 minutes).
After the expiration, the links will not be valid anymore, and a new request to this endpoint has to be made to obtain new download links.

An example of the response for this call could be:

```json
{
  "urls": [
    "https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tour-inventory.b2b.tourradar.com/bulk_data/operators/operator_id%3D204/locale_id%3D1/tour_departures.2021-11-03.13-29-08.229377.0.json.gz?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256[...]&x-id=GetObject",
    "https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tour-inventory.b2b.tourradar.com/bulk_data/operators/operator_id%3D204/locale_id%3D1/tour_departures.2021-11-03.13-29-08.229377.1.json.gz?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256[...]x-id=GetObject",
    "https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tour-inventory.b2b.tourradar.com/bulk_data/operators/operator_id%3D204/locale_id%3D1/tour_departures.2021-11-03.13-29-08.229377.2.json.gz?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256[...]&x-id=GetObject"
  ],
  "expires_in": 600
}
```

The content of the files that will be downloaded will look like this:

```json
[
  {
    "tour_id": 1492,
    "departure_dates": [
      {
        "id": 722685916,
        "date": "2022-05-07",
        "type": "scheduled",
        "guide_languages": [
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 722685917,
        "date": "2022-05-21",
        "type": "scheduled",
        "guide_languages": [
          1
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "tour_id": 1493,
    "departure_dates": [
      {
        "id": 722685694,
        "date": "2022-04-23",
        "type": "scheduled",
        "guide_languages": [
          1
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
```

For each departure, the file contains the identifier, date, type, and languages the tour is offered in.
Those data are the same available in the **[tours/{tourId}/departures](#tag/Pricing-and-Availability/paths/~1v1~1tours~1{tourId}~1departures/get)** endpoint.

Bulk data is updated regularly at least once per day (schedule may vary for different operators).
